sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Shared review transaction and response
  accDescr: A role-authorized same-origin request enters a bounded transaction. Membership and owned run are locked. The expected version must match before state and an audit event commit together. Conflicts and uncertain responses preserve the draft.
  autonumber
  participant UI as Shared review editor
  participant API as PUT /api/review/:id/state
  participant Auth as Session boundary
  participant DB as PostgreSQL transaction

  UI->>API: Origin + cookie + JSON<br/>Expected version, owner, note, dismissed
  API->>API: Exact configured origin
  API->>Auth: Require reviewer or admin session
  Auth-->>API: Installation + numeric actor + current role
  API->>API: Authorized request:<br/>JSON size and shape limits
  alt Access or input rejected
    API-->>UI: 400 / 401 / 403 / 408 / 413 / 415
    UI->>UI: Retain draft, explain corrective action
  else Request accepted
    API->>DB: Begin bounded transaction
    DB->>DB: Lock membership FOR SHARE<br/>Recheck role and installation
    DB->>DB: Lock owned AnalysisRun<br/>FOR UPDATE
    alt Access lost or run unavailable
      DB-->>API: Rollback, access denied or run not found
      API-->>UI: 403 or 404, no review mutation
    else Owned run and write permission confirmed
      DB->>DB: Compare expected version<br/>with stored version
      alt Version conflict
        DB-->>API: Rollback
        API-->>UI: 409, reload before another save
        UI->>UI: Keep draft visible<br/>Mark save unconfirmed
      else Version matches
        DB->>DB: Create or compare-and-update<br/>Increment version
        DB->>DB: Append actor-attributed<br/>review event
        DB->>DB: Read state + latest 20 events<br/>Commit transaction
        DB-->>API: Confirmed snapshot
        API-->>UI: 200 + no-store
        UI->>UI: Validate version<br/>Replace draft and history<br/>Refresh inbox using active filters
      end
    end
  end
  Note over UI,DB: A timeout or lost response can leave commit outcome uncertain.<br/>The draft stays visible, reload server state before retrying.
